type: software
title: "DeepAcoustics"
abstract: "A GUI-based deep learning tool for passive acoustic monitoring, modified from DeepSqueak for marine bioacoustic data, with multi-class call detection, interactive network training and processing of large datasets. Developed by Ocean Science Analytics in collaboration with Acoustic Interactions."
